id=wadb
name=Wireless ADB AutoStart (wadb)
version=1.1
versionCode=1
author=workbuddy
description=Boot watchdog that guarantees adbd listens on tcp:5555. Pure late_start, no post-fs-data, no mounts — cannot block boot. Persists persist.adb.tcp.port=5555 (lost on reflash). Kill switch: touch /data/adb/wadb/disable. Log: /data/local/tmp/wadb.log
